{"4052480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Overcoming Fear - Joshua's Saga", "steam_appid": 4052480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/610bc5b39d5f5e0a8f7b0f74a5dc13d9.poster.avif?t=1768279072\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=772 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/610bc5b39d5f5e0a8f7b0f74a5dc13d9.webm?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/610bc5b39d5f5e0a8f7b0f74a5dc13d9.mp4?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Fear Within and Beyond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time of desert and silence, Joshua stands before a calling that transcends human understanding. After the death of Moses, the weight of leadership falls upon him — a man of shaken courage, struggling against fear and doubt. Amid inner voices and outer battles, he must discover that true strength does not come from weapons, but from faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/0071dada02f32df318352ae7fd26c1cb.avif?t=1768279072\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Spiritual and Epic Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overcoming Fear – The Saga of Joshua</i> is a cinematic action-adventure experience that blends mythological and biblical elements in a harsh, dark, and mysterious world. With every step, Joshua faces not only enemies and creatures that test his faith, but also the reflection of his deepest fears — his own Shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/b49f03d0642f24297e945670d5411817.poster.avif?t=1768279072\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=772 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/b49f03d0642f24297e945670d5411817.webm?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/b49f03d0642f24297e945670d5411817.mp4?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>God Speaks, and the Desert Answers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From forgotten temples to valleys of ashes, divine echoes guide Joshua on his journey. The voice of God challenges, shapes, and transforms him, as the desert becomes the stage for both miracles and trials. Each altar is a meeting between faith and courage — each battle, a struggle for the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/029f80d66e95ab0630b002609bb2851f.poster.avif?t=1768279072\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=772 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/029f80d66e95ab0630b002609bb2851f.webm?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/029f80d66e95ab0630b002609bb2851f.mp4?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Combat and Cinematic Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With third-person cameras and visceral combat mechanics, the game delivers impact and emotion in every strike. Swords, spiritual powers, and moments of raw tension blend with an orchestral soundtrack to create an immersive experience — where every confrontation is also a battle within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/83e6824c1d1697eaf970ee20df721857.poster.avif?t=1768279072\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=772 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/83e6824c1d1697eaf970ee20df721857.webm?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/83e6824c1d1697eaf970ee20df721857.mp4?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/610bc5b39d5f5e0a8f7b0f74a5dc13d9.poster.avif?t=1768279072\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=772 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/610bc5b39d5f5e0a8f7b0f74a5dc13d9.webm?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/610bc5b39d5f5e0a8f7b0f74a5dc13d9.mp4?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Fear Within and Beyond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time of desert and silence, Joshua stands before a calling that transcends human understanding. After the death of Moses, the weight of leadership falls upon him — a man of shaken courage, struggling against fear and doubt. Amid inner voices and outer battles, he must discover that true strength does not come from weapons, but from faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/0071dada02f32df318352ae7fd26c1cb.avif?t=1768279072\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Spiritual and Epic Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overcoming Fear – The Saga of Joshua</i> is a cinematic action-adventure experience that blends mythological and biblical elements in a harsh, dark, and mysterious world. With every step, Joshua faces not only enemies and creatures that test his faith, but also the reflection of his deepest fears — his own Shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/b49f03d0642f24297e945670d5411817.poster.avif?t=1768279072\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=772 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/b49f03d0642f24297e945670d5411817.webm?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052480/extras/b49f03d0642f24297e945670d5411817.mp4?t=1768279072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>God Speaks, and the Desert Answers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From forgotten temples to valleys of ashes, divine echoes guide Joshua on his journey. The voice of God challenges, shapes, and transforms him, as the desert becomes the stage for both miracles and trials. Each altar is a meeting between faith and courage — each battle, a struggle for the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide